  "solution": "Vì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên với điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math> bất kỳ, ta có \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tMặt khác, áp dụng quy tắc hình hộp ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> thẳng hàng và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>E</mi><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>91</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>E</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>191</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>191</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>61</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
